@Cart.API_HostAddress = https://localhost:7017

### 1) GET carrito de María → 200 (Notebook × 1 y Silla × 3)
GET {{Cart.API_HostAddress}}/api/cart/a1b2c3d4-0000-0000-0000-111122223333

### 2) POST agregar 2 Notebooks → 200 (suma: queda Notebook × 3)
POST {{Cart.API_HostAddress}}/api/cart/a1b2c3d4-0000-0000-0000-111122223333/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productoId": "3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6",
  "cantidad": 2
}

### 3) Error 422 CRT-003 contando lo que ya hay: la Silla tiene stock 8, María ya tiene 3, agrega 6 → 9
POST {{Cart.API_HostAddress}}/api/cart/a1b2c3d4-0000-0000-0000-111122223333/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productoId": "aaaabbbb-cccc-dddd-eeee-ffff00001111",
  "cantidad": 6
}

### 4) PUT reemplazar la cantidad de la Notebook por 4 → 200
PUT {{Cart.API_HostAddress}}/api/cart/a1b2c3d4-0000-0000-0000-111122223333/items/3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cantidad": 4
}

### 5) Error 422 CRT-003 en el PUT: 11 Notebooks (stock 10)
PUT {{Cart.API_HostAddress}}/api/cart/a1b2c3d4-0000-0000-0000-111122223333/items/3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cantidad": 11
}

### 6) DELETE quitar la Notebook → 204
DELETE {{Cart.API_HostAddress}}/api/cart/a1b2c3d4-0000-0000-0000-111122223333/items/3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6

### 7) Error 404 CRT-001: quitar un producto que no está en el carrito (la Remera) — decisión del equipo
DELETE {{Cart.API_HostAddress}}/api/cart/a1b2c3d4-0000-0000-0000-111122223333/items/bbbbcccc-dddd-eeee-ffff-000011112222

### 8) POST a un usuario sin carrito (Juan) → 200: el primer POST crea el carrito
POST {{Cart.API_HostAddress}}/api/cart/b2c3d4e5-0000-0000-0000-222233334444/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productoId": "bbbbcccc-dddd-eeee-ffff-000011112222",
  "cantidad": 1
}

### 9) DELETE vaciar el carrito de Juan → 204
DELETE {{Cart.API_HostAddress}}/api/cart/b2c3d4e5-0000-0000-0000-222233334444

### 10) GET carrito de Juan → 200 con items vacío (el carrito sigue existiendo)
GET {{Cart.API_HostAddress}}/api/cart/b2c3d4e5-0000-0000-0000-222233334444

### Error 404 CRT-001: usuario sin carrito (Laura)
GET {{Cart.API_HostAddress}}/api/cart/c3d4e5f6-0000-0000-0000-333344445555

### Error 404 CRT-002: producto que no existe en Products
POST {{Cart.API_HostAddress}}/api/cart/a1b2c3d4-0000-0000-0000-111122223333/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productoId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "cantidad": 2
}

### Error 400 CRT-004: cantidad inválida
POST {{Cart.API_HostAddress}}/api/cart/a1b2c3d4-0000-0000-0000-111122223333/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productoId": "3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6",
  "cantidad": 0
}

### Error 500 CRT-005: falla interna simulada
GET {{Cart.API_HostAddress}}/api/cart/ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff
Accept: application/json

### Health check con un Correlation ID propio
GET https://localhost:7017/health
Accept: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: mi-id-de-prueba-123

### Health ready: con Products prendido, "products" tiene que dar Healthy
GET https://localhost:7017/health/ready